{"created": "2025-10-09T18:33:49.131609+00:00", "modified": "2025-11-03T16:56:24.452351+00:00", "id": 17307846, "conceptrecid": "17289930", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17307846", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.17289930", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17307846", "metadata": {"title": "FieldVitis", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17307846", "publication_date": "2025-10-09", "description": "<p>This dataset is designed for <strong>deep learning applications in grape leaf disease identification</strong>. It consists of real-world images of grape leaves captured <em>in loco</em>, representing natural lighting conditions, variable backgrounds, and diverse leaf orientations. The images encompass both healthy specimens and leaves affected by common grapevine diseases, being classified into <em>four</em> classes: <strong>Black_rot</strong>, <strong>Esca</strong>, <strong>Leaf_blight</strong>, and <strong>Healthy. </strong>The class distribution is as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Healthy:</strong> 158 images</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Black_rot:</strong> 39 images</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Esca:</strong> 200 images</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Leaf_blight:</strong> 158 images</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This dataset was constructed by integrating samples from the following publicly available sources:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong><a title=\"ESCA-dataset\" href=\"https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/89cnxc58kj/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ESCA-dataset</a></strong>&mdash; License: CC BY 4.0</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong><a title=\"PlantDoc-Dataset\" href=\"https://github.com/pratikkayal/PlantDoc-Dataset\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PlantDoc-Dataset</a> </strong>&mdash; License: CC BY 4.0</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong><a title=\"Grape Disease\" href=\"https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/wkymf8bhcg/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grape Disease</a></strong> &mdash; License: CC BY 4.0</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Images from these sources were manually selected and, in some cases, cropped to better focus on the grape leaves. The resulting dataset maintains the integrity of the original data while providing a more standardized format for deep learning experiments.&nbsp;We extend our sincere thanks to the authors and contributors of these datasets for their efforts in collecting and sharing valuable open-access resources.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Farinati Leite, Eduardo", "affiliation": "SENAI Innovation Institute for Sensing Systems (ISI-SIM)", "orcid": "0009-0000-7346-5827"}, {"name": "Brizola Fontoura, Lucas", "affiliation": "Center for Embedded Devices and Research in Digital Agriculture (CEDRA) of SENAI-RS", "orcid": "0009-0009-7307-9323"}, {"name": "de Freitas, Augusto", "affiliation": "Center for Embedded Devices and Research in Digital Agriculture (CEDRA) of SENAI-RS", "orcid": "0009-0009-0092-3001"}, {"name": "Valiati, Jo\u00e3o Francisco", "affiliation": "SENAI Innovation Institute for Sensing Systems (ISI-SIM)", "orcid": "0000-0001-8870-1909"}], "keywords": ["grape disease", "deep learning", "classification"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "17289930"}}]}}, "title": "FieldVitis", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/17307846", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/17307846", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/17307846?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17307846", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17307846", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.17307846", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/17307846/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/17289930", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/17289930", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17289930", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.17289930", "self_iiif_